function cpsAssertManifest(mysqli $db,string $p): void {$s=cpsState($db,$p);if($s===null)throw new TestFailure('canonical provenance table absent');$c=fn($x)=>implode('|',[$x['COLUMN_NAME'],$x['COLUMN_TYPE'],$x['IS_NULLABLE'],$x['COLUMN_DEFAULT']===null?'NULL':$x['COLUMN_DEFAULT'],$x['EXTRA'],$x['CHARACTER_SET_NAME']??'NULL',$x['COLLATION_NAME']??'NULL']);assertSameValue(['id|bigint(20) unsigned|NO|NULL|auto_increment|NULL|NULL','output_kind|varchar(40)|NO|NULL||utf8mb4|utf8mb4_unicode_ci','legacy_object_id|bigint(20) unsigned|NO|NULL||NULL|NULL','output_id|bigint(20) unsigned|NO|NULL||NULL|NULL','source_cutoff_at|datetime|NO|NULL||NULL|NULL','classification_version|varchar(80)|NO|NULL||utf8mb4|utf8mb4_unicode_ci','category|varchar(40)|NO|NULL||utf8mb4|utf8mb4_unicode_ci','reason_codes_json|text|NO|NULL||utf8mb4|utf8mb4_unicode_ci','classification_sha256|char(64)|NO|NULL||utf8mb4|utf8mb4_unicode_ci','created_at|datetime|NO|NULL||NULL|NULL'],array_map($c,$s['columns']),'exact ten-column semantic manifest');assertSameValue([],$s['domainConstraints'],'no FK/CHECK constraints');assertSameValue('InnoDB:utf8mb4_unicode_ci',$s['table']['ENGINE'].':'.$s['table']['TABLE_COLLATION'],'exact engine/collation');}
